OL,3,GNEWSAWorkout group aims to help men
OL,4,Athrough dark moments
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fitness coach said he set up a free
OL,7,Fworkout group because he wanted to
OL,8,Fcreate a community to support men
OL,9,Fmentally and physically through "dark
OL,10,Fmoments".
OL,12,FThe group, named Brotherhood, was
OL,13,Ffounded by gym-owner Liam Richardson in
OL,14,FYaxley, Cambridgeshire, at the
OL,15,Fbeginning of September.
OL,17,FRichardson, 33, said people attending
OL,18,Fhis sessions at Culture Club Training
OL,19,Fgrew from just three members to 40 in
OL,20,Fsix weeks.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
